00:59:33.520 --> 00:59:35.740
Oh, overly animated Angela.
哦，过于活跃的安吉拉。

1449
00:59:36.120 --> 00:59:37.040
She was trying.
她当时在努力尝试。

1450
00:59:37.600 --> 00:59:39.840
Maybe he should just do some Mad Libs.
也许他应该去玩玩填词游戏。

1451
00:59:39.900 --> 00:59:40.620
You love those.
你很喜欢那些。

1452
00:59:40.900 --> 00:59:45.740
I love Mad Libs and keep suggesting cakes that look like cats or cat accessories.
我喜欢“疯狂填词”游戏，还一直建议做些猫咪造型或者猫咪配饰造型的蛋糕。

1453
00:59:46.100 --> 00:59:47.140
It's the way to your heart.
那是通往你心里的路。

1454
00:59:47.560 --> 00:59:49.840
Well, Jim has arrived at Pam's dorm room.
好了，吉姆到了帕姆的宿舍门口。

1455
00:59:50.000 --> 00:59:52.620
Did you notice that Pam is the resident advisor?
你注意到帕姆是宿舍管理员了吗？

1456
00:59:52.880 --> 00:59:53.300
I did.
我注意到了。

1457
00:59:53.560 --> 00:59:54.420
She's the RA!
她是宿舍管理员！

1458
00:59:55.060 --> 00:59:56.100
It's so perfect.
太完美了。

1459
00:59:56.640 --> 00:59:59.880
It's perfect, but it's also like Pam.
这很完美，但也很有帕姆的风格。

1460
01:00:00.320 --> 01:00:01.520
Take on a job.
接下一份工作。

1461
01:00:01.940 --> 01:00:02.720
Come on!
得了吧！

1462
01:00:03.640 --> 01:00:06.260
Well, Jim tells the documentary crew, you know what?
吉姆告诉纪录片摄制组，你知道吗？

1463
01:00:06.300 --> 01:00:08.080
Why don't you go check out Pam's art over there?
你们为什么不去看看那边帕姆的艺术作品？

1464
01:00:08.200 --> 01:00:11.300
And when they turn to look for it, he quickly shuts the door, right?
当他们转头去看的时候，他迅速关上了门，对吧？

1465
01:00:11.440 --> 01:00:11.680
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1466
01:00:12.020 --> 01:00:16.100
And at 18 minutes, 31 seconds, you hear the cameraman sigh.
在18分31秒的时候，你听到了摄影师叹气。

1467
01:00:16.100 --> 01:00:18.560
You hear Randall Einhorn sigh.
你听到了兰德尔·艾因霍恩的叹气声。

1468
01:00:18.700 --> 01:00:20.000
Yes, that's Randall!
没错，那是兰德尔！

1469
01:00:20.200 --> 01:00:21.440
And that was improvised.
那是即兴发挥的。

1470
01:00:21.740 --> 01:00:24.660
He just did that, and they loved it, and they kept it in.
他当时就那么做了，他们很喜欢，就保留了下来。

1471
01:00:24.840 --> 01:00:25.340
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1472
01:00:25.480 --> 01:00:26.100
So fun.
太有趣了。

1473
01:00:26.340 --> 01:00:32.780
I would like to say, Pam, thank you for finally wearing a hoodie or any kind of casual clothing
我想说，帕姆，谢谢你终于在艺术学校穿上了连帽衫或者其他休闲服装。

1474
01:00:32.780 --> 01:00:34.020
here at art school.
在这里。

1475
01:00:34.220 --> 01:00:37.620
I feel like she just has been overdressed since she got there.
我觉得她自从到了那里就一直穿得太正式了。

1476
01:00:37.680 --> 01:00:39.380
We are on two different pages on this.
在这点上我们意见不合。

1477
01:00:39.480 --> 01:00:42.060
I think that Pam has looked amazing for art school.
我觉得帕姆在艺术学校的打扮看起来棒极了。

1478
01:00:42.340 --> 01:00:43.820
I love her ponytail.
我喜欢她的马尾辫。

1479
01:00:43.820 --> 01:00:49.500
I just think, and this was a choice that, I should say that, this has all been a choice.
我只是觉得，而且这是一个选择，我应该说，这一切都是刻意为之的。

1480
01:00:49.500 --> 01:00:50.500
It's on purpose.
这是故意的。

1481
01:00:50.780 --> 01:00:56.100
It's all to make her stand out a little bit, to be like, she isn't dressing the way the
这一切都是为了让她显得与众不同，就像是，她并没有像现在的年轻人那样穿衣。

1482
01:00:56.100 --> 01:00:57.760
young people dress today.
没错。

1483
01:00:57.880 --> 01:00:58.160
Right.
对。

1484
01:00:58.160 --> 01:01:02.400
Okay, so, like, I'm giving her grief about it, but you guys, we planned this.
好吧，我是在拿这事开玩笑，但伙计们，这是我们计划好的。

1485
01:01:02.580 --> 01:01:02.740
Right.
没错。

1486
01:01:02.860 --> 01:01:06.180
And also her affected speech, how she's like, top of the morning, Telia.
还有她那种做作的说话方式，比如“早上好啊，泰莉亚”。

1487
01:01:06.920 --> 01:01:07.840
Shall we walk over here?
我们要走过去吗？

1488
01:01:07.980 --> 01:01:08.820
Perhaps we'll sit here.
也许我们坐在这儿。

1489
01:01:09.400 --> 01:01:11.380
Let me cross my legs in my stockings.
让我穿着丝袜交叉双腿。

1490
01:01:11.800 --> 01:01:12.820
What are you talking about?
你在说什么呢？

1491
01:01:12.980 --> 01:01:13.840
That's how she talks.
她就是那样说话的。

1492
01:01:14.000 --> 01:01:14.780
No, she does not.
不，她才没有。

1493
01:01:15.800 --> 01:01:16.680
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

1494
01:01:16.860 --> 01:01:17.980
I'm just messing with you.
我只是在逗你玩。

1495
01:01:17.980 --> 01:01:18.880
I really got worried.
我刚才真的担心了。

1496
01:01:18.940 --> 01:01:19.780
I was like, what?
我心想，什么？

1497
01:01:20.340 --> 01:01:21.760
I am messing with you.
我是在逗你玩呢。

1498
01:01:22.080 --> 01:01:26.560
I don't know how long Jim and Pam got to hang out and smooch, but Pam got a knock on
我不知道吉姆和帕姆能有多少时间待在一起亲热，但帕姆的门被敲响了。

1499
01:01:26.560 --> 01:01:26.920
her door.
门外有个女孩因为别人拿了她的豆奶而对另一个女孩大发雷霆。

1500
01:01:27.200 --> 01:01:31.400
There was some girl mad at another girl because someone took someone's soy milk.
有个女孩因为别人拿了她的豆奶而对另一个女孩大发雷霆。

1501
01:01:31.580 --> 01:01:36.820
And now Jim is in, like, the dorm room common area at 18 minutes, 55 seconds.
现在吉姆在宿舍公共区域，时间是18分55秒。

1502
01:01:37.480 --> 01:01:39.600
Yeah, he's watching a baseball game.
没错，他正在看棒球比赛。

1503
01:01:39.600 --> 01:01:46.160
Yes, and Jenna, you can very faintly hear some sort of baseball commentators, like announcers,
是的，珍娜，你可以隐约听到一些棒球评论员的声音，就像播音员一样，

1504
01:01:46.360 --> 01:01:47.060
sports announcers.
体育播音员。

1505
01:01:47.260 --> 01:01:47.400
Yeah.
没错。

1506
01:01:47.780 --> 01:01:52.400
Those were played by our very own producer, James O'Kerry and Eric Colgen.
那些声音是我们自己的制片人詹姆斯·奥凯里和埃里克·科尔根配的。

1507
01:01:52.640 --> 01:01:53.040
All right.
好的。

1508
01:01:53.220 --> 01:01:56.440
See, I wondered, is that a real baseball game?
你看，我当时就在想，那是真的棒球比赛吗？

1509
01:01:56.580 --> 01:02:00.520
So it's obviously real baseball footage, but then we put our own commentators on it.
所以很明显那是真实的棒球比赛录像，但我们加上了自己的评论员配音。

1510
01:02:00.600 --> 01:02:01.300
That's right.
没错。

1511
01:02:01.620 --> 01:02:03.540
So Jenna and I have been in touch with James.
我和珍娜一直有跟詹姆斯联系。

1512
01:02:03.780 --> 01:02:04.440
He is fantastic.
他太棒了。

1513
01:02:04.440 --> 01:02:06.940
He was that guy that could, like, get you anything on set.
他就是那种在片场什么都能给你搞到的人。

1514
01:02:06.940 --> 01:02:08.640
If you needed it, James got it.
只要你需要，詹姆斯就能弄到。

1515
01:02:08.640 --> 01:02:12.600
And we had lots of questions for him, and he answered them for this episode.
我们有很多问题要问他，他都为这一集一一解答了。

1516
01:02:12.840 --> 01:02:14.440
He even had the shooting draft.
他甚至还保留着拍摄剧本。

1517
01:02:14.660 --> 01:02:15.920
James, thank you so much.
詹姆斯，太感谢你了。

1518
01:02:16.080 --> 01:02:17.800
I feel like we might have a Jamesopedia.
我觉得我们可能要拥有一本“詹姆斯百科”了。

1519
01:02:18.440 --> 01:02:20.160
Yeah, it couldn't come at a better time.
是啊，这真是再好不过了。

1520
01:02:20.520 --> 01:02:20.960
Yeah.
没错。

1521
01:02:21.300 --> 01:02:24.260
You know, because we don't have Kentopedia anymore, James.
你知道，因为我们不再有“肯特百科”了，詹姆斯。

1522
01:02:25.140 --> 01:02:28.860
James Carey, will you be our Jamesopedia?
詹姆斯·凯里，你愿意成为我们的“詹姆斯百科”吗？

1523
01:02:31.020 --> 01:02:33.520
Should we talk about Stanley's birthday?
我们要聊聊斯坦利的生日吗？

1524
01:02:34.040 --> 01:02:35.680
I mean, it looks a little sad.
我是说，看起来有点凄凉。

1525
01:02:36.080 --> 01:02:37.680
Everyone's standing around eating fruit.
大家都在旁边站着吃水果。

1526
01:02:37.820 --> 01:02:39.620
Ronnie wants to know if anyone wants to dance.
罗尼想问有没有人想跳舞。

1527
01:02:40.020 --> 01:02:44.120
By the way, my Dolly Parton fans, did you catch the song playing?
顺便问一下，我的多莉·帕顿粉丝们，你们注意到背景里放的歌了吗？

1528
01:02:44.280 --> 01:02:44.720
Oh, yeah.
哦，听到了。

1529
01:02:45.180 --> 01:02:46.700
Here you come again.
《Here You Come Again》。

1530
01:02:47.060 --> 01:02:48.260
I love that song.
我超爱这首歌。

1531
01:02:48.420 --> 01:02:49.380
I love that song, too.
我也超爱这首歌。

1532
01:02:49.500 --> 01:02:51.660
I went and listened to it after I watched the episode.
看完这一集后，我又专门去听了一遍。

1533
01:02:52.020 --> 01:02:54.620
It's not the song I would play at a birthday party.
这不是我会在生日派对上放的歌。

1534
01:02:55.200 --> 01:02:55.640
No.
确实不是。

1535
01:02:55.960 --> 01:02:56.400
No.
不是。

1536
01:02:57.460 --> 01:02:58.480
Probably not.
大概不会。

1537
01:02:59.160 --> 01:03:00.860
But I love that song.
但我确实很喜欢这首歌。

1538
01:03:01.100 --> 01:03:07.200
People are going to sneak off from this party, and they're going to have some cake in the warehouse.
人们会从派对上溜走，去仓库里吃蛋糕。

1539
01:03:07.580 --> 01:03:10.720
The warehouse is the sneak site, clearly.
仓库显然就是那个“偷情地点”。

1540
01:03:11.580 --> 01:03:11.980
Clearly?
显然吗？

1541
01:03:12.280 --> 01:03:18.940
And I mean, isn't Angela uncomfortable being in that room with all those other people, including her fiance?
我是说，安吉拉和那么多人待在一个房间里，包括她的未婚夫，她难道不觉得不自在吗？

1542
01:03:19.840 --> 01:03:21.540
She doesn't have any guilt about it.
她对此毫无愧疚感。

1543
01:03:21.640 --> 01:03:22.360
I guess not.
我想也是。

1544
01:03:22.600 --> 01:03:24.000
She has no problem sleeping at night.
她晚上睡觉一点心理负担都没有。

1545
01:03:24.180 --> 01:03:24.940
We've established that.
这一点我们已经确认过了。

1546
01:03:24.940 --> 01:03:25.500
That's true.
确实如此。

1547
01:03:26.320 --> 01:03:29.580
Stanley is in the room with the cake, but he's not even eating it.
斯坦利在放蛋糕的房间里，但他甚至都没吃。

1548
01:03:29.720 --> 01:03:31.140
He said his tastes have changed.
他说他的口味变了。

1549
01:03:31.600 --> 01:03:38.220
Now all he likes is baklava, which I thought was a really interesting thing to say, because baklava is very, very, very sweet.
现在他只喜欢吃果仁蜜饼，我觉得这说法很有意思，因为果仁蜜饼真的非常非常甜。

1550
01:03:38.220 --> 01:03:40.060
Like, if you've lost your sweet tooth.
就好像你已经不再爱吃甜食了一样。

1551
01:03:40.200 --> 01:03:41.000
I mean, it's nutty.
我是说，这太疯狂了。

1552
01:03:41.780 --> 01:03:42.940
I love a baklava.
我超爱果仁蜜饼。

1553
01:03:43.060 --> 01:03:43.480
I do, too.
我也是。

1554
01:03:43.580 --> 01:03:44.400
It's dense, though.
不过它很扎实。

1555
01:03:44.600 --> 01:03:46.580
It's a dense, sugary treat.
这是一种扎实又甜腻的甜点。

1556
01:03:47.060 --> 01:03:47.660
I know.
我知道。

1557
01:03:47.820 --> 01:03:50.820
And I often eat too much of it, and I get a stomach ache.
我经常吃太多，结果胃疼。

1558
01:03:51.400 --> 01:03:55.340
Because, you know, they give you a tiny piece, and I'll eat like five of them.
因为你知道，他们给的是一小块，而我能吃掉五块左右。

1559
01:03:55.700 --> 01:03:56.940
Because they're just so good.
因为它们实在太好吃了。

1560
01:03:57.220 --> 01:03:58.640
Well, that's what happens with you.
嗯，你就是这样。

1561
01:03:58.900 --> 01:04:00.480
You're always like, Ange, look how cute.
你总是说，安吉，看这个多可爱。

1562
01:04:00.500 --> 01:04:01.160
It's so tiny.
它太小了。

1563
01:04:01.620 --> 01:04:02.160
I know.
我知道。

1564
01:04:02.240 --> 01:04:03.720
And then you're like, Ange, I have a stomach ache.
然后你又会说，安吉，我胃疼。

1565
01:04:03.900 --> 01:04:04.340
I know.
我知道。

1566
01:04:04.880 --> 01:04:09.060
Dwight, Holly, Michael, and Ronnie spy on the group.
德怀特、霍莉、迈克尔和罗尼在暗中监视那群人。

1567
01:04:09.360 --> 01:04:11.320
Dwight's like, they should not be in there.
德怀特说，他们不应该在那里面。

1568
01:04:11.440 --> 01:04:11.700
Mm-mm.
嗯嗯。

1569
01:04:11.920 --> 01:04:13.280
You know why he's saying that.
你知道他为什么这么说。

1570
01:04:13.700 --> 01:04:16.560
And Michael says, we should have our own party.
然后迈克尔说，我们应该办我们自己的派对。

1571
01:04:16.680 --> 01:04:18.040
Let's all go play mini golf.
我们去打迷你高尔夫吧。

1572
01:04:18.800 --> 01:04:21.880
Ronnie and Michael and Dwight and Holly.
罗尼、迈克尔、德怀特和霍莉。

1573
01:04:22.100 --> 01:04:22.820
That foursome.
那四个人。

1574
01:04:23.140 --> 01:04:24.460
Oh, I wish that happened.
哦，我真希望那是真的。

1575
01:04:24.540 --> 01:04:25.140
Me, too.
我也是。

1576
01:04:25.620 --> 01:04:28.100
Well, Holly can't go because she has a date tonight.
好吧，霍莉去不了，因为她今晚有约会。

1577
01:04:29.160 --> 01:04:31.540
And then Michael has the sweetest talking head.
然后迈克尔有一段最暖心的采访。

1578
01:04:31.720 --> 01:04:33.260
He's like, Holly doesn't need any luck.
他说，霍莉不需要什么好运。

1579
01:04:33.260 --> 01:04:36.060
Like, everyone who meets her instantly loves her.
因为每个见到她的人都会立刻喜欢上她。

1580
01:04:36.960 --> 01:04:37.160
Yeah.
是啊。

1581
01:04:37.440 --> 01:04:38.180
So cute.
太可爱了。

1582
01:04:38.200 --> 01:04:40.060
I want these two kids to get together.
我真希望这两个孩子能在一起。

1583
01:04:40.640 --> 01:04:45.060
Angela, I have a question for you about the next scene, which is when Dwight busts in and
安吉拉，关于下一场戏我有个问题，就是德怀特闯进去然后

1584
01:04:45.060 --> 01:04:46.340
he kicks over the cake.
他踢翻了蛋糕。

1585
01:04:46.520 --> 01:04:46.760
Yeah.
对。

1586
01:04:47.100 --> 01:04:48.060
I wasn't there.
我当时不在场。

1587
01:04:48.200 --> 01:04:48.960
I'm at art school.
我在艺术学校。

1588
01:04:49.200 --> 01:04:50.580
What was it like to shoot that scene?
拍摄那场戏是什么感觉？

1589
01:04:50.740 --> 01:04:51.380
Here's the thing.
是这样的。

1590
01:04:51.720 --> 01:04:56.720
That room was like, I mean, Jenna, it was like six feet by six feet.
那个房间，我是说，珍娜，大概只有六英尺乘六英尺那么大。

1591
01:04:57.060 --> 01:04:58.520
It is really small.
真的非常小。

1592
01:04:58.520 --> 01:04:59.860
And we were all in there.
我们当时都挤在里面。

1593
01:04:59.860 --> 01:05:04.580
They tried to put chairs in so that we could sit, but not everyone could sit, obviously.
他们试着放了椅子让我们坐，但显然不是每个人都能坐下。

1594
01:05:05.320 --> 01:05:06.760
We were pretty crammed in.
我们挤得满满当当的。

1595
01:05:06.920 --> 01:05:09.100
I remember I couldn't look at Phyllis or I would laugh.
我记得我当时不能看菲利斯，否则我会笑场。

1596
01:05:10.080 --> 01:05:13.980
Whenever she had her exchange with Michael, she would kind of start to break a little.
每当她和迈克尔有对手戏时，她就会有点憋不住笑。

1597
01:05:14.320 --> 01:05:18.960
And then Rain kicked over that cake with such force.
然后雷恩用力踢翻了那个蛋糕。

1598
01:05:19.220 --> 01:05:20.480
It went flying.
蛋糕直接飞了出去。

1599
01:05:20.960 --> 01:05:22.820
We all got cake on us.
我们身上都沾到了蛋糕。

1600
01:05:23.180 --> 01:05:24.720
And then they would have to clean it up.
然后他们就得清理现场。

1601
01:05:24.860 --> 01:05:28.180
We couldn't do it very many times because we were like, Rain, do you have to kick it that
我们没法拍太多次，因为我们当时在想，雷恩，你非得踢得那么

1602
01:05:28.180 --> 01:05:28.740
hard?
用力吗？

1603
01:05:29.960 --> 01:05:34.020
So pretty much, I just remember being crammed in and trying not to laugh.
所以基本上，我只记得当时挤在一起，努力憋着不笑。

1604
01:05:34.200 --> 01:05:36.680
Well, I thought that scene looked like it was a lot of fun to shoot.
